# Everything is LF, on every machine. The tree ships shell scripts, and a CRLF shebang line
# breaks bash with "bad interpreter"; Python on Windows already emits CRLF from write_text
# unless told not to, so nothing here may depend on the checkout translating line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
